        {
          "text": "to ndelo mar'abirio obedo ndelo pa Rwoth Were mewin. I ndelo no wongoye ŋata wotim tic; win, nyithindho, ŋecin, ogwaŋe mewin, kosa japath ma bedo i piny mewin. ",
