          "text": "I ndelo aucel An, Rwoth, acweyo polo gi piny, nam gi gima nitie iye je, to aywomere i ndelo mar'abirio. Riameno Rwoth omiyo ndelo ma Sabato silwany to loko maleŋ.”",
